# value (byte - 1). NFK v3 database files store field digits as raw bytes
# and kv3.nix decodes each byte through this table, so the table is a
# format constant shared by every NFK v3 database: it is NOT part of any
# database file. Generated by
#   python3 build_db3.py --write-table nfd3-table.nix
# and imported once per eval by kv3.nix (Nix import cache).
#
# The file intentionally contains raw (non-UTF-8) bytes: Nix accepts them
# in string literals, and escaping is only used for the four bytes that
# would break the literal (0x0A -> \n, 0x0D -> \r, 0x22 -> \", 0x5C
# -> \\). Do not hand-edit.
